stream
BT /F2 30 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 770.00 Tm (RTI Online) Tj ET
BT /F1 18 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 730.00 Tm (User Manual) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 700.00 Tm (Right to Information portal - citizen guide) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 636.00 Tm (1. About this portal) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 609.00 Tm (RTI Online lets any citizen of India ask a public authority for information under the Right to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 593.50 Tm (Information Act, 2005, and follow that request through to a reply. You can file a request, pay the fee,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 578.00 Tm (track progress, escalate through appeals, and reconcile a payment that did not go through - all from) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 562.50 Tm (this site.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 536.00 Tm (This manual walks through each of those tasks in the order you are likely to need them.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 489.50 Tm (2. Do I need an account?) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 462.50 Tm (No. Filing a request does not require signing in. You can complete the whole form as a guest, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 447.00 Tm (you will be given a registration number at the end.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 420.50 Tm (Signing in is still worth it. An account fills the applicant details in for you, keeps every request you) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 405.00 Tm (have filed in one list under RTI Request History, and collects notifications as your requests) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 389.50 Tm (progress. You can sign in with a username and password, or through DigiLocker.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 343.00 Tm (3. Filing an RTI request) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 316.00 Tm (1.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76 316.00 Tm (Choose RTI Request in the top navigation, or Submit a Request on the home page.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 294.50 Tm (2.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76 294.50 Tm (Read the guidelines shown before the form opens, and accept them to continue.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 273.00 Tm (3.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76 273.00 Tm (Pick the ministry or department your question belongs to. If you are not sure, open Public) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76 257.50 Tm (Authorities and search - the directory covers every listed authority and suggests the closest) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76 242.00 Tm (match.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 220.50 Tm (4.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76 220.50 Tm (Fill in your details and write your question in the request text box.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 199.00 Tm (5.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76 199.00 Tm (Enter the security code shown beside the box, then submit.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 171.50 Tm (Keep your question specific and factual. A public authority is required to supply information it) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 156.00 Tm (already holds; it is not required to create new analysis, offer opinions, or answer hypothetical) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 140.50 Tm (questions.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 94.00 Tm (4. Fees) Tj ET
endstream
