stream
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 770.00 Tm (The application fee is Rs 10 for a non-BPL applicant. If the authority supplies photocopied pages, an) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 754.50 Tm (additional fee of about Rs 2 per page may be charged before the documents are released.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 728.00 Tm (Applicants below the poverty line pay no fee, but must attach a valid BPL certificate to the request.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 712.50 Tm (The form asks for this when you mark yourself as a BPL applicant.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 686.00 Tm (Payments can be made by SBI internet banking, SBI debit card, Master or Visa card, or UPI.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 639.50 Tm (5. If a payment fails) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 612.50 Tm (Sometimes money leaves your account but no registration number appears. Do not pay again - the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 597.00 Tm (first attempt is usually still being settled by your bank, and paying twice creates two records to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 581.50 Tm (untangle.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 555.00 Tm (1.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76 555.00 Tm (Open Payment Reconciliation from the top navigation.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 533.50 Tm (2.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76 533.50 Tm (Enter the email address you filed with. Add the mobile number if you have it; leave it blank if you) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76 518.00 Tm (are unsure.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 496.50 Tm (3.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76 496.50 Tm (Enter the security code and submit.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 475.00 Tm (4.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76 475.00 Tm (On the next screen, choose Check Latest Status to ask the bank where the payment stands.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 447.50 Tm (You will get one of three answers. Payment Confirmed means the fee arrived and a registration) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 432.00 Tm (number has been generated - it is shown on the same screen. Refund Initiated means the payment) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 416.50 Tm (failed and the amount returns to your account within five to seven working days; nothing was filed,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 401.00 Tm (so you can safely file again. Awaiting Bank Confirmation means the bank has not settled it yet;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 385.50 Tm (registration numbers are generated after the bank scroll is reconciled, which takes 24 to 48) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 370.00 Tm (working hours.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 343.50 Tm (If nothing has changed after 48 hours, contact the helpdesk with the transaction ID from that screen.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 297.00 Tm (6. Tracking a request) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 270.00 Tm (Choose View Status and enter your registration number together with the email address used when) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 254.50 Tm (filing. Signed-in users go straight to RTI Request History instead, which lists every request with its) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 239.00 Tm (current status and the next action due.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 212.50 Tm (A public authority must normally respond within 30 days. If your request was sent to the wrong) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 197.00 Tm (authority, it is transferred within 5 days and the 30-day clock runs from the transfer. Where the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 181.50 Tm (information concerns the life or liberty of a person, the reply is due within 48 hours.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 135.00 Tm (7. First appeal) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 108.00 Tm (You may file a first appeal if you are dissatisfied with the reply, or if no reply arrived within the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 92.50 Tm (statutory period. File it within 30 days of receiving the reply, or of the date the reply was due.) Tj ET
endstream
