BT /F2 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 770.00 Tm (1.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76 770.00 Tm (Choose First Appeal in the top navigation.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 748.50 Tm (2.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76 748.50 Tm (Enter the registration number of the original request and the email address you filed it with.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 727.00 Tm (3.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76 727.00 Tm (Your details and the authority are filled in from that request; add your grounds for appeal.) Tj ET
BT /F2 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 705.50 Tm (4.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 76 705.50 Tm (Submit. You will receive a separate appeal registration number.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 678.00 Tm (There is no fee for a first appeal. The First Appellate Authority should decide within 30 days,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 662.50 Tm (extendable to 45 days where reasons are recorded.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 616.00 Tm (8. Second appeal and complaints) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 589.00 Tm (If the first appeal is decided against you, or is not decided at all, you may file a second appeal with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 573.50 Tm (the Central or State Information Commission within 90 days.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 547.00 Tm (Separately, a complaint may be made to the Commission under Section 18 - for example where an) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 531.50 Tm (authority refused to receive your request, or no Public Information Officer was designated. A) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 516.00 Tm (Section 18 complaint has no time limit.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 469.50 Tm (9. Notifications) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 442.50 Tm (Signed-in users get a notification when a request changes state - a reply received, an appeal due, a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 427.00 Tm (deadline approaching. The bell in the top bar shows how many are unread. Open All Notifications to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 411.50 Tm (filter by read and unread, mark individual items as read, or clear the whole list at once.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 365.00 Tm (10. RTI Sahayak) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 338.00 Tm (RTI Sahayak is the assistant in the lower-right corner. It can explain the process, help you word a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 322.50 Tm (request, and point you at the right public authority out of the full directory.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 296.00 Tm (Never type an OTP, Aadhaar number, card number, bank account number, PIN or password into the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 280.50 Tm (chat. Messages containing them are refused before they are sent. No genuine officer will ever ask) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 265.00 Tm (you for those in a chat window.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 218.50 Tm (11. Accessibility) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 191.50 Tm (The strip above the navigation bar controls text size. A+ enlarges the interface, A- reduces it, and A) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 176.00 Tm (returns it to normal. Your choice is remembered on this device.) Tj ET
BT /F2 14 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 129.50 Tm (12. Getting help) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 102.50 Tm (Use Contact Us for the helpdesk form, or the FAQs page for the questions asked most often. When) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 56 87.00 Tm (writing in about a specific request, always quote the registration number, or the transaction ID if) Tj ET
endstream
